button clicked
getSnapshot called
getSnapshot called
rendered with value 1
getSnapshot called
getSnapshot called
rendered with value 1
unsubscribe called
subscribe called
```
<img width="535" height="273" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8daa8e72-53b3-422a-a052-df787408def8" />

